WEBVTT

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:40.870
I'm leaving, Yusaku!

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:42.870
G-Grandma?!

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:45.750
I'll be home by dinnertime.

00:01:46.230 --> 00:01:48.250
Wh-What's with that getup?

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:52.090
How rude! I'm going
to my class reunion.

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:55.090
Grandma's just being a woman.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:58.150
It's her first city-adventure
in a long time.

00:01:58.290 --> 00:01:59.310
A woman...

00:01:59.670 --> 00:02:01.780
You're going out, too, Manager?

00:02:02.110 --> 00:02:04.150
How beautiful you look!

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:06.800
Why are you so dressed up?
Got a date?

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:10.900
Nothing like that.
I'm seeing my parents.

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:13.680
Manager, there's something
on your skirt.

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:15.940
Huh?

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:21.490
Manager looks...

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:23.810
too beautiful today.

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:39.030
Yukari!

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:41.840
Kaoru! I've been
waiting for you!

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:44.240
Well, see you!

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:46.710
Bye!

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.740
Grandma! Your wallet!
Your wallet!

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:49.970
Don't need it.

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:52.310
I'll get dropped
off afterwards, too.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:53.840
Off we go!!

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.190
How loud she can be.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:02.690
Grandma's so excited. It's
her long-awaited class reunion.

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:04.560
Of course.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.490
I hope you're not late.

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:09.500
I better get going.

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:12.060
I'll try to get back
as early as I can.

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:13.820
Take your time.

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:16.400
You haven't had lunch alone
with your parents in a while.

00:03:16.470 --> 00:03:18.340
Say good-bye, Taro.

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:23.180
Thank you! Good-bye.

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:26.130
Today is the promised day.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:28.880
Your mom's coming back!

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:33.020
I see. When I come back,
you'll be gone.

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:36.460
I should have changed
this lunch to another day.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:40.060
C'mon! It's your
father's birthday, right?

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:43.930
But it's so much more fun
to play with these kids.

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:47.870
Hana, it's time for good-bye.

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:55.440
They look great on you.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.190
Those earrings.

00:03:59.030 --> 00:04:00.750
Do you think so?

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:03.690
It's too early in the day
to start getting romantic.

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:14.690
Ms. Otonashi,
I'm here to pick you up.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:18.200
Mitaka? Why?

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:22.670
Sorry I'm so late.
I got stuck in traffic.

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:26.250
Did I keep you waiting?

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.260
Mitaka!

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:31.240
Hey, Godai. Who's that kid?

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:33.790
Never mind. What
are you doing here?

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:35.440
Huh? What?

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:36.540
I said.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:40.510
I thought you said it's gonna
be just you and your parents?

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:42.580
That's what I thought

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:46.020
Let's go, Ms. Otonashi

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:47.300
Um..

00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:51.020
See you, Godai!

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:06.680
So...what does all this...mean?

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:11.790
I guess it means Manager's parents
really got to like Mitaka.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.490
Good going, Mitaka.

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:19.660
I see. So this means marriage
is Just a matter of time.

00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:40.510
So this means marriage
is just a matter of time.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:48.430
Her reaction...

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:51.580
Manager didn't know Mitaka
was coming to get her.

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:57.870
I get it! Mitaka's planning
to deceive her into marriage!

00:05:58.610 --> 00:05:59.960
Over my dead body!

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:08.070
Sorry! Don't cry. Your mama
will be here very soon.

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:10.700
Where the heck is Kasumi?

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:12.640
I can't leave.

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:17.350
Taro...?

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:25.020
Have you seen Taro?

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:26.790
Taro?

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:27.790
No.

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:40.610
So you didn't know
that I'd be joining you?

00:06:41.490 --> 00:06:42.310
No.

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:46.580
That's strange. I thought
your mother told you.

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:51.440
Mom! You tricked me!

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:56.380
She must not know that
my parents will be there, too.

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:03.040
Then you'll be even more
surprised when we get there.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.320
Wh-What do you mean?

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:08.890
You'll see when we get there.

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:50.940
T-Taro?!

00:07:51.710 --> 00:07:53.680
When did you sneak
into the vroom-vroom?

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:58.820
I'm sorry. This must
be a surprise to you.

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:01.120
A little.

00:08:13.070 --> 00:08:15.760
Stop scowling, because you're
not getting out of this.

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:21.440
You better greet
Mitaka's parents properly.

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:24.310
Kyoko's future depends on this.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:25.850
Kyoko!

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:29.680
Mitaka, thank you
for coming.

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:31.240
The pleasure's all mine.

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:32.530
Dear!

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:39.530
Mr. Chigusa, it's been a while.

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:49.720
Kyoko! That outfit
looks great on you.

00:08:50.740 --> 00:08:51.720
Auntie!

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:59.240
Auntie, there's a mirror
over there that's THIS big!

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:00.550
Really?

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.190
Who's this child?

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:04.350
He tagged along.

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:07.450
He lives in your
apartment building?

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:08.560
Well, yes.

00:09:09.300 --> 00:09:12.740
Tagged along? What'll we do?

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:17.820
Little boy, will you be okay
alone for a little while?

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:19.630
Mom!

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:22.770
We can use the babysitting
service at the hotel.

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:24.780
No. He's coming with us.

00:09:26.020 --> 00:09:28.540
This is not one of those
casual occasions, is it?

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:29.940
What do you mean by that?

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:33.880
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:38.310
We're so sorry we're late.
Have you been waiting long?

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:41.950
They're my parents.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.800
Now do you get it?
It's a crucial day for you.

00:09:52.140 --> 00:09:52.900
No.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:56.700
Nice to meet you.
I'm Kyoko's mother.

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:57.970
Nice to meet you, too.

00:09:58.150 --> 00:09:59.600
This is Kyoko.

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:01.050
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:02.880
Nice to meet you.

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:06.100
She's beautiful

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:09.340
Shun, I'm in love
at first sight!

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:14.520
I never imagined
she'd be so lovely.

00:10:16.060 --> 00:10:17.430
Shall we go to lunch?

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:19.690
Yes, let's.
Kyoko..?

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:21.690
Dear!

00:10:23.570 --> 00:10:24.170
Uh.

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:25.590
Yes...?

00:10:26.010 --> 00:10:29.300
Will you excuse me? I'd like
to make a phone call

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:29.990
Phone call?

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:35.180
Yes. They must be
worried about him at home.

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:49.160
Maison Ikkoku.

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:51.130
Manager?

00:10:53.270 --> 00:10:54.850
Taro's with you?

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:58.190
Great. No wonder
we couldn't find him.

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:01.590
So don't worry.

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:04.100
And.

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:18.550
May I go over there
to get him?

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:22.520
Yes. Please.

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:25.020
Hurry.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:27.760
Come as soon as you can.

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:35.560
Mrs. Ichinose!
Could you watch.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:39.700
Huh? What?!

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:43.010
"Kasumi, I've gone out with the kids.
Please wait here. Godai"

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:51.420
Manager, I'm coming!
Wait for me!

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:18.610
May I go over there
to get him?

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:21.330
Yes. Please.

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:22.720
Hurry

00:12:24.230 --> 00:12:27.150
Something's not right. It must
not be her father's birthday.

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:38.970
The more I look at her,

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:40.900
the more wonderful
I think your daughter is.

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:43.360
I think she's great, too.

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:53.850
I can't say Kyoko has
any great talent,

00:12:53.930 --> 00:12:56.610
but her greatest asset
is her kindness.

00:12:57.650 --> 00:12:59.850
Don't forget to chew, okay?

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:01.730
Kyoko?

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:02.510
What?

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:05.590
Is someone really going
to come and get him?

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:07.620
Yes. I'm sure
he'll be here soon.

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:10.020
Who will that be?

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:12.250
I wonder.

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:15.790
It's all right.
He's a quiet little boy.

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:19.210
We'd like to get to
know you, Kyoko. Right, Dear?

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:20.240
Sure.

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:21.850
Of course.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.270
I wonder what's
taking Godai' so long?

00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:28.950
I suppose Godai's coming
to get the boy.

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:32.360
I hope you don't mind me asking,
but how old are you?

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.180
Mom, I told you the other day.

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:38.730
I'm well past my prime, really.
I'll be 26 soon.

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:45.160
He's already 30!

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:47.440
That's a perfect
age difference!

00:13:47.610 --> 00:13:48.760
I agree!

00:13:50.740 --> 00:13:53.500
You look so much
younger than your age.

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:57.310
Please.. After all, I'm a widow.

00:13:57.610 --> 00:14:01.110
I'm not nearly as vivacious
as other women my age!

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:18.100
I love your honesty.

00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:20.840
We love you more and more.

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:29.480
Ms. Otonashi, why don't we take
a walk in the garden after lunch?

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:31.390
Good idea!

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:33.000
But I...

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:37.880
Don't worry. We'll take
good care of this boy.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:41.290
You young people
spend some time together.

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:42.590
Okay.

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:03.740
We're finally alone.

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:04.740
Yes.

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:10.280
I guess your father
doesn't like me.

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:11.720
well

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:15.720
It's okay. I think
I can understand

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:17.750
how a father must feel
about his daughter.

00:15:18.570 --> 00:15:22.790
But they say things change once
grandchildren come along.

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:29.500
What's taking Godai so long?

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:33.470
This way, sir.

00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:40.270
Lunch at a place like this?
How pretentious.

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:41.770
Please.

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:44.750
Excuse me.

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:48.990
Great! We've been
waiting for you.

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:49.610
Chief!

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:52.010
Chief!

00:15:52.210 --> 00:15:54.490
Thank you, Mr. Mitaka.

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.130
Let's play again sometime.

00:15:57.210 --> 00:15:58.630
Bye-bye, Taro.

00:15:59.900 --> 00:16:01.340
Mitaka's parents?

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:04.840
Thanks for taking him.

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:06.440
Where is Manager?

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:08.370
Thank you for coming.

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:16.230
Chief? Chief?

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:19.510
Their parents met
with each other?

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:22.330
I had no idea things
have come this far.

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:25.990
Chief, let's go out
to the garden.

00:16:26.530 --> 00:16:27.830
Auntie's there.

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:29.330
Really, Taro?

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:30.690
Let's go.

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:34.570
Yusaku! What are you
doing here?

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:37.240
Grandma!? Is your
class reunion here?

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:39.890
You came to pick me up?

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:43.030
N-No. I'm in
a rush, actually.

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:47.870
Wait up! Since you're here,
I want you to meet my friends.

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:49.480
Come this way.

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:52.220
G-G-Grandma!

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:57.060
Everybody! My grandson's
here to liven up the party!

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.520
What a nice young man!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:01.320
Have a drink!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.050
How old are you?

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:07.760
Hey! Yusaku!

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:10.030
What's up with him?

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:18.310
My parents are
quite frank, aren't they?

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:19.530
They sure are.

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:24.080
I think you'll be able to
get along well with them.

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:29.230
Mitaka, I

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:32.160
Ms. Otonashi,
let's go this way.

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:42.740
The two of us can't go off
to see the ocean.

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:46.120
If we leave now, we'll be
able to see the sunset.

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:50.180
Please wait here. I'll go
tell our parents of our plan.

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:56.810
He's so pushy!

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:05.550
Don't cry. I'll change
your diaper now. Good girl

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.370
Hi, Godai.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.260
Mitaka.

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:14.240
Using a child to try to
break up a marriage meeting?

00:18:14.300 --> 00:18:15.970
You're as petty as usual.

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:17.560
You should talk!

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:20.030
You deceived the manager to..

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:24.210
"Deceived"?
How vulgar that sounds!

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:25.450
Where is she?

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:27.050
I wonder.

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:27.960
Mitaka!

00:18:28.990 --> 00:18:33.730
Anyway, I won't let her
go home tonight.

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:38.460
How dare you!

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:41.760
Look, Hanako! Fish!

00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:43.320
Taro! Don't move!

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:52.170
That was close.
You're safe now.

00:18:52.420 --> 00:18:53.800
Come this way.

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:02.390
Bye, Godai!

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:03.990
Hold it!

00:19:09.740 --> 00:19:10.820
S-Sir?!

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:18.170
Manager!

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:24.200
Godai!

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:26.910
Manager!!

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:29.030
Please stop.

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:29.990
Why?

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:31.340
Because...

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:34.350
Godai will take care
of those kids.

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:36.580
Please indulge me awhile.

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:38.750
Mitaka, I...

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:40.790
Or are you afraid of me?

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:41.780
No.

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:45.190
I'm so glad you trust me.

00:20:07.550 --> 00:20:08.740
I'm hungry.

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:17.970
Wanna eat ramen
when we get back?

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:20.740
Yeah! Yeah!

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:21.960
Do you like ramen?

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:27.740
I also like curry, hamburger,
omelet, banana.

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:29.400
Chief, do you like bananas?

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:32.180
Yes, I do.

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:38.240
Soichiro!

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:47.250
Kasumi's not back yet?

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:55.250
The view is best
from this hotel.

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:57.900
It really is beautiful

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:01.330
Well, why don't we toast?

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:13.270
You must be exhausted
from all that's happened.

00:21:13.930 --> 00:21:14.720
No.

00:21:15.430 --> 00:21:17.850
But you've been rather.

00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:22.340
I've always been audacious.

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:29.260
If I weren't aggressive with you,

00:21:29.330 --> 00:21:31.170
you wouldn't come with me.

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:33.500
I'm sorry. I...

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:36.760
I'm so glad I'm
having the chance

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:39.330
to show you this
night view.

00:21:44.350 --> 00:21:46.720
I'd like the
'52 Chateau Rouge.

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:48.340
Yes, sir.

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:56.750
You don't mind having
another glass?

00:21:58.140 --> 00:22:01.160
No, but I don't want it
to get too late.

00:22:01.760 --> 00:22:02.550
Your earring.

00:22:03.830 --> 00:22:04.850
It's falling off.

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:19.150
You won't be able to drive
if you drink too much.

00:22:19.490 --> 00:22:21.420
I'll be fine by morning.

00:22:23.660 --> 00:22:25.040
I've booked us a room.

00:22:28.170 --> 00:22:29.430
M-Mitaka?!

00:22:31.260 --> 00:22:34.320
If not tonight, I'll
book a room tomorrow night

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:41.090
And the next night,
and the next.

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:44.270
Until you open up
your heart to me,

00:22:45.150 --> 00:22:47.000
I'll continue to book a room.

00:22:53.780 --> 00:22:56.270
C'mon, Godai!
Drink with us!

00:22:56.900 --> 00:23:00.700
She'll be here soon whether
you wait there or not!

00:23:01.170 --> 00:23:03.430
We're going to eat up
all the leftovers

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:04.890
Grandma brought back!

00:23:05.200 --> 00:23:06.780
Are you listening?!

00:23:07.560 --> 00:23:10.850
Yusaku! Just forget
about Manager!

00:23:11.500 --> 00:23:13.090
Shut up, dried squid!

00:23:13.210 --> 00:23:14.320
What did you call me?!

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:16.100
Please, Grandma.

00:23:16.180 --> 00:23:19.200
Just leave the sourpuss alone.
It's more fun without him.

00:23:19.580 --> 00:23:20.450
I agree!

00:23:26.660 --> 00:23:28.840
I won't let her
go home tonight.

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:30.390
He's bluffing!

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:33.750
Manager would
never agree to..

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:38.990
Manager...

00:23:49.440 --> 00:23:51.380
She never came home,
did she?

00:23:51.440 --> 00:23:53.460
This is scandalous!

00:23:53.550 --> 00:23:55.350
Let's not kid ourselves.

00:23:55.420 --> 00:23:57.850
We all know what happens
between a man and a woman.

00:23:58.450 --> 00:23:59.350
N-No way!

00:23:59.430 --> 00:24:03.480
Next: "One Thousand Percent Suspicious!
Kyoko's Scandalous Night"

00:24:03.720 --> 00:24:06.050
Kyoko, what happened?
